WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.820
Our Centres – Ō Tātou Pūtahi

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.500
With the majority of post-earthquake restoration
work now complete in the Kaiapoi and Rangiora

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.120
Town Centres, we now turn our minds towards
the long-term future of all our centres.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.840
Retailing trends are evolving, online shopping
is prevalent and big box stores are increasingly popular.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.420
It’s vital our town centres are ‘lifestyle’
centres with complementary activities and

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.680
community, recreational and entertainment facilities

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.580
all creating a place where people like to spend time.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.020
Our District - Our Future, Waimakariri 2048
aims to:

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.260
So what do you think?

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:23.020
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.280
waimakariri.govt.nz

